# Public, build-time configuration for production builds (Cloudflare Worker
# via `npm run build:vinext`, and `next build`). Every value here is inlined
# into JavaScript that browsers download, so none of them is a secret:
#   - the Supabase anon key is the public client key (RLS is the boundary);
#   - the Stripe price, GTM and Turnstile ids are public identifiers.
# Server secrets never go here: they are Worker secrets
# (`npx wrangler secret put NAME --name relationship-copilot`).
# Real environment variables override this file (CI placeholders, local
# .env.local), so builds stay configurable.
# Verified against the live production bundles on 2026-10-14.

